# spec: inline JSON body, Content-Type selects the body kind
### create-issue
POST https://api.github.com/repos/octocat/hello-world/issues
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{githubToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Found a bug",
  "body": "I am having a problem with this.",
  "assignees": ["octocat"],
  "milestone": 1,
  "labels": ["bug"]
}
